otal":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!--\r\nPLEASE HELP US PROCESS GITHUB ISSUES FASTER BY PROVIDING THE FOLLOWING INFORMATION.\r\n\r\nISSUES MISSING IMPORTANT INFORMATION MAY BE CLOSED WITHOUT INVESTIGATION.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## I'm submitting a...\r\n<!-- Check one of the following options with \"x\" -->\r\n<pre><code>\r\n[x] Regression (a behavior that used to work and stopped working in a new release)\r\n[ ] Bug report  <!-- Please search GitHub for a similar issue or PR before submitting -->\r\n[ ] Feature request\r\n[ ] Documentation issue or request\r\n[ ] Support request => Please do not submit support request here, instead see https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#question\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\n## Current behavior\r\nRemove item from FormArray, and then submit the form causes the exception:\r\n```\r\nERROR TypeError: Cannot read property 'updateOn' of null\r\n    at eval (VM1742 forms.umd.js:2519)\r\n    at Array.forEach (<anonymous>)\r\n    at syncPendingControls (VM1742 forms.umd.js:2517)\r\n    at FormGroupDirective.onSubmit (VM1742 forms.umd.js:6806)\r\n    at Object.eval [as handleEvent] (VM1817 HeroDetailComponent.ngfactory.js:276)\r\n    at handleEvent (VM1736 core.umd.js:13571)\r\n    at callWithDebugContext (VM1736 core.umd.js:15080)\r\n    at Object.debugHandleEvent [as handleEvent] (VM1736 core.umd.js:14667)\r\n    at dispatchEvent (VM1736 core.umd.js:9983)\r\n    at eval (VM1736 core.umd.js:10608)\r\n    at HTMLFormElement.eval (VM1734 platform-browser.umd.js:2669)\r\n    at ZoneDelegate.invokeTask (VM1692 zone.js:275)\r\n    at Object.onInvokeTask (VM1736 core.umd.js:4763)\r\n    at ZoneDelegate.invokeTask (VM1692 zone.js:274)\r\n    at Zone.runTask (VM1692 zone.js:151)\r\n```\r\n\r\nFor removing item I use `removeAt` on FormArray object:\r\n```\r\n  onDelete(index) { \r\n    this.secretLairs.removeAt(index);\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n\r\nReproduces in Angular 5, but worked in previous release (angular 4)\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior\r\nNo exception is thrown after removing item, form successfully submitted\r\n\r\n\r\n## Minimal reproduction of the problem with instructions\r\nThe repro example can be found here:\r\nhttps://embed.plnkr.co/uifYPiyvCfpuRcwcrm2K/\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce:\r\n1. Select `Whirlwind` hero \r\n2. Press `Del` button under the `Address #1`\r\n3. Press `Save`\r\n4. Press `Del` button under the `Address #1` one more time\r\n5. Press `Save`\r\n6. Exception was thrown\r\n\r\n## What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?\r\n<!-- Describe the motivation or the concrete use case. -->\r\nIt worked in angular 4, and in new 5th version the functionality of removing items from FormArray is broken.\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\n\r\n<pre><code>\r\nAngular version: 5.2.0\r\n<!-- Check whether this is still an issue in the most recent Angular version -->\r\n\r\nBrowser:\r\n- [x] Chrome (desktop) version 63\r\n- [ ] Chrome (Android) version XX\r\n- [ ] Chrome (iOS) version XX\r\n- [ ] Firefox version XX\r\n- [ ] Safari (desktop) version XX\r\n- [ ] Safari (iOS) version XX\r\n- [ ] IE version XX\r\n- [ ] Edge version XX\r\n \r\nFor Tooling issues:\r\n- Node version: 8.0.0\r\n- Platform:  Windows \r\n\r\nOthers:\r\n<!-- Anything else relevant?  Operating system version, IDE, package manager, HTTP server, ... -->\r\n</code></pre>\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"jasonaden","id":516168,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNjE2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/516168?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonaden","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonaden/starred{/owner}